<p>When the Khol starts and the second Kaler chooses a type, you must solve that type. This depends on the time given by the Checker or the time specified in the Jolan.</p>
<p>If the type is solved incorrectly, Kaler 1 must provide a recording of the correct answer to the Checker and post it in the Tunnel. The decision is up to the Checker.</p>
<p>Another note: Copy and paste is allowed if it is mentioned in the Jolan. Both Kalers can submit copy-pasted answers.</p>
<p>Another note: You must always answer through a recording.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Note 29</h3>
<p>If the King or Tunnel receives a Sik penalty, Kaler 2 receives the Sik penalty.</p>
</div>

